{"articleNo":"165736","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=165736&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017 KGSP Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at kit, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.02.02","hit":"2339","attachments":[{"name":"2. 2017 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=165736&attachNo=77173"},{"name":"4. 2017 KGSP-G Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=165736&attachNo=77174"},{"name":"1. 2017 KGSP-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=165736&attachNo=77722"},{"name":"3. 2017 KGSP-G Application FAQs (ENGLISH-KOREAN).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=165736&attachNo=77891"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2017 </font><span style=\"COLOR: blue\">KGSP Admission Call</span><font color=\"#000000\"> for Graduate School Studying at kit, Korea<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\"><font color=\"#000000\">We are pleased to inform you of 2017 KGSP(Korean Government Scholarship Program) Guideline for Master’s or Doctoral candidates here in Korea. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%\">As the only national engineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate quite a few candidates. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">This might be a great opportunity for you to be able to study in Korea with a government full scholarship. <o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><font color=\"#000000\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please send me </font><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal\"><u><span style=\"COLOR: red\">one original application document package </span></u></b></span><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">no later than March 26</span></u></b><b><u><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">th </font></span></sup></u></b><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">(Sunday) 2017</span></u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">. Your original application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline. <b><o:p></o:p></b></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80% from your university.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">2. Applicants who submit applications to more than two designated institutions will be disqualified.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">3. Scholarship duration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of Master'), Doctoral(1 yr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">4. Applicants must be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1st, 2017(born after Sep. 1, 1977).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">5. In case of submitting photocopied documents, applicants MUST have the copies notarized or apostilled and then submit the notarized or apostilled copies. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no e-mail application will be accepted).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-style: italic\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">For further information, please see attached, visit website(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><a href=\"http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\">http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a><span style=\"COLOR: black\">) or contact KGSP coordinator, Eugene Park. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Submission Deadline</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"> : 26<sup>th</sup> March 2017</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Submission address</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"> : <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea, <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Kumoh National Institute of Technology<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Techno Building 4<sup>th</sup> floor, T458, (Postal Code 39177)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: DejaVuSans-Bold; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">International Programs and Language Education Center<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></b>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: red; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\">Contact Person</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; COLOR: black; mso-font-kerning: 0pt\"> : <o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none\" align=\"left\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT